---
description: Mandatory Football Engine status in major development and research reports
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `docs/research/ENGINE_STATUS_REPORTING_RULE_V1.md` in every major report.
Include its entire ENGINE STATUS block separately from Pipeline status.
Reverify version, promotion and sample claims against repository artifacts.
Infrastructure completion is not an engine upgrade; implementation is not promotion.
Separate Official Forward, research candidates and prospective shadow cohorts.
Never substitute a mission's zero new predictions for cumulative Forward counts.
State model/cohort, source artifact and evidence timestamp for every sample count.
Missing or stale evidence must be labeled UNKNOWN / LAST_VERIFIED, not invented.
V4 Phase 0 foundation is not a V4 engine or admission permission.
